OL,3,GNEWSASculptures mark huge tree loss
OL,4,Aafter Storm Goretti
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaning life-size sculptures have been
OL,7,Finstalled at a woodland which suffered
OL,8,F"significant tree loss" during Storm
OL,9,FGoretti, according to the National
OL,10,FTrust.
OL,12,FThe willow artwork created by Katherine
OL,13,FMiles is on display at Trengwaiton
OL,14,FGarden, near Penzance in Cornwall and
OL,15,Fdepicts a family of three "leaning into
OL,16,Fthe wind" while holding onto their
OL,17,Fhats.
OL,19,FThe trust said 150 trees fell at the
OL,20,Fsite during the storm in January 2026,
OL,21,Fwhich brought wind speeds of more than
OL,22,F90mph in west Cornwall.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
