OL,3,GNEWSASculptures mark huge tree loss
OL,4,Aafter Storm Goretti
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead gardener, Tom Bush, said: "With
OL,7,Fclearance work now nearing completion,
OL,8,Fwe're looking forward to starting the
OL,9,Freplanting in October and beginning the
OL,10,Fnext stage of the garden's recovery."
